OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe chance of some early
OL,6,Fbrighter spells, particularly across
OL,7,FShetland, but cloud soon thickening
OL,8,Ffrom the southwest to bring some
OL,9,Fpatchy rain to Orkney by mid-morning,
OL,10,Fwhich extends to Shetland from around
OL,11,Fnoon. Winds southerly increasing
OL,12,Fstrong for the afternoon.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FPatchy rain turning heavy at
OL,15,Ftimes overnight, before clearing to
OL,16,Fonly a few light showers for Orkney,
OL,17,Fpossible Shetland, towards dawn, as
OL,18,Fsoutherly gales veer to a strong
OL,19,Fsouthwesterly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
