OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FAny persistent rain across
OL,6,FShetland soon clearing. Otherwise a
OL,7,Fmix of scattered showers and brighter
OL,8,Fspells during morning. Outbreaks
OL,9,Fbuilding for afternoon, bringing the
OL,10,Frisk of thunderstorms. Brisk southwest
OL,11,Fwinds.
OL,12,
OL,13,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,14,FWednesday very windy with rain, which
OL,15,Fturns heavy at times. A mix of
OL,16,Fbrighter spells and scattered showers
OL,17,Ffor Thursday and Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
